OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after woman found
OL,4,Adead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a woman was found dead in
OL,8,FDarlington.
OL,10,FDurham Police said they were called to
OL,11,Fan address in Parkgate at 21:15 BST on
OL,12,FWednesday.
OL,14,FA woman, believed to be in her 40s, was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene but formal
OL,16,Fidentification has yet to taken place,
OL,17,Fthe force said.
OL,19,FA 44-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of murder and a 27-year-old
OL,21,Fman was arrested on suspicion of
OL,22,Fassisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
